{{for|the legacy master system that retired in [[version 3.5.0]]|Master (Forsaken Masters)}}
'''Masters''' are four special [[NPC]]s who are allied with the player and offer special missions during the Act [[campaign]] and inside [[map]]s, and can be invited to your [[hideout]] to interact with.

In their current form, masters work like most other forms of [[Extra Content]] and have a chance to appear randomly in acts.

In maps, they either requires to apply [[thread]] in order to spawn, or farm specific map for Delve case.

==Overview==
Masters appear in the town where the area level is appropriate and offer tutorial quests to players. It is not required to complete these quests in order to have them spawn in other areas
